### Plain Language Summary

The MBR (Master Boot Record / Master Context Index) is your project's elevator pitch for AI assistants. When a session starts fresh or recovers from compaction, this file gives the AI enough context to be useful immediately. It answers: "What is this project? What's the architecture? What are we working on? What should I not touch?"

Keep it under 100 lines. If it's growing beyond that, you're putting too much detail here -- that belongs in Session.md or dedicated context files.
